{"version":1,"content":"<p>「聲夢小花」姚焯菲（Chantel）早前作客網絡頻道節目，談及海外留學歷程，Chantel坦言初期前往新西蘭時，曾因當地生活節奏緩慢及難以融入當地圈子而感到極度孤獨，甚至出現溝通障礙，其後轉往紐約求學，同時兼顧演藝事業與學業，沉重壓力更令她</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:37.453369+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:02.793818+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:02.793818+00:00","content_hash":"236e24b3ea338dc5a21eb0e4005166dffd7d7bb6ed50ad87b0458195d453aad6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}